/-- **`End(E_ℚ̄)` IS NOT DEFINED OVER `ℚ`: some `σ ∈ Γ_ℚ` conjugates `φ` to
`1 − φ`** (sorry leaf, cut 2026-07-28 out of `not_stable_of_cmEndomorphism`;
items 1–2 of that node's theory list).

