/-- **The ramified branch: a curve over `ℚ` with CM by the maximal order of
`ℚ(√−p)` has at most ONE `Γ_ℚ`-stable line of order `p`** (PROVEN 2026-07-28
over `not_forall_galoisScalar_of_cmEndomorphism` and the `ψ = 2φ − 1` block
