> `(A.classify A.strM A.dM).1 : A.M ⟶ A.Y` is surjective on `ℚ̄`-points.

Given a lift `m : Spec ℚ̄ ⟶ A.M` of `y.1`, `exists_gamma0Datum_baseChange`
