The assembly below additionally PROVES the `j`-rationality step —
`W.j = algebraMap ℚ ℚ̄ j₀` — from `exists_jSection_algClosModel` and
`exists_rationalJ_of_galoisInvariant` (the latter PROVEN), so that work is not
