  subst hd
  -- and such a datum is a Weierstrass curve whose `j` is the value of `jm`
  exact exists_weierstrass_jm_of_gamma0Datum hp hmem hj d

/-- **Mazur 1978 §5 on the elliptic-curve side** (sorry node, introduced
