**`hg` IS LOAD-BEARING and the statement is FALSE without it**: at
`N = 1`, `X_0(1) = ℙ¹` and the open immersion `𝔸¹ ⊂ ℙ¹` is a nonconstant
witness over every base.  `hmodel` is load-bearing twice over — it
