  CURVE–JACOBIAN half": `exists_isAbelianWeilEigenvalues`, which is
  **curve-free** (Weil for abelian varieties: `#A(𝔽_{ℓⁿ}) = ∏ (1 − βᵢⁿ)`),
  and `prod_one_sub_eq_of_isJacobianOf`, the curve–Jacobian comparison.
