## WHAT IS ALREADY WORKED OUT, so the next owner does not redo it

* `w_J` is ADDITIVE and an INVOLUTION, and equals `IsJacobianOf.mapEnd w hw`.
  Additivity: `hchar` at `g = 𝟙`, `x = o` gives `post w_J (ab.zero 𝟙)`
