proven.

**`_hnew` MAY NOT BE DROPPED, and the witness is `N = 74`.**  `_hL` HOLDS
at `74` — all four newforms are Atkin–Lehner-minus
(`mfatkineigenvalues(mfinit([74,2],0),74) = [[-1,-1],[-1,-1]]`) with
