with `c` constant in the second coordinate.  So `hA`'s pair may not be
used as it stands.

**The repair, as carried out.**  Translate `c` by the constant `c o`,
where `o` is the Abel–Jacobi base point that `jac` already carries:
`c' g x := c g x − c o`, the subtraction taken in `RelPoint astr g` and
the constant moved from the base point `𝟙` to the base point `g` by
