**What proving it needed**: exactly one theorem beyond `hA` and the
universal property — that the image of a homomorphism of abelian
varieties is an abelian subvariety, so that `B` exists and `π`
corestricts.  That is `exists_surjectiveAbelianImage_of_isAdditiveOn`, stated
