| `N` | genus | cusps | `c(N)` | best `ℓ` | `#X_0(N)(𝔽_ℓ)` | route |
|-----|-------|-------|--------|----------|------------------|-------|
| 20  | 1 | 6  | 6 | 3  | 6 | closes |
| 24  | 1 | 8  | 8 | 5  | 8 | closes |
| 28  | 2 | 6  | 6 | 5  | 6 | closes |
| 30  | 3 | 8  | 8 | 17 | 8 | closes |
| 36  | 1 | 12 | 6 | 5  | 6 | closes |
